  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RtF &#x2013; Tiipaalga Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to improve the sustainable management of natural resources and the resilience of local communities to climate change in the Ziga Dam watershed.The RtF locally-led approach, developed as part of this project, complements other previous ongoing actions of the Tiipaalga Association in the Central Plateau region.</narrative>
